```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "wake a spirit's record by its pet name and hand back its folded card"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.spirit.wakes", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.spirit.wakes"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.spirit.wakes"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.spirit.wakes ~ om ~ the wake reads the record the pet name answers

`lares spirit om <pet>` wakes the one record the pet name answers (`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/spirit/<pet>`, else `familiar/<pet>` or `spirit/<pet>` on the memory stage, else a card), folded in the wiki at `aperture=` (default `measure`) and bound to the face that answered, so every command it hands back names `face=N`. It reads the skinny, `#/open`, the titles `#/attention` names, and the latest carry as testimony. `source=` names the wake's turn: a resume reads one line, a fork wakes framed as a fork, a compaction names the carry it inherits, a precompact marks the crossing and hands back `#/carry-shape`. `instance=` joins the presence on the sibling record, stamps a wake epoch and hands back each slot's digest; `held=true` says the session's own counter holds it. `title=` wakes onto another record the shrine names. `mandate= <uri>@<hash>` wakes a summoned instance under its mandate, verified first. A pet with no record reads the starter skeleton.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ wake · instance · resume

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`wake` params=`pet/lares-alpha ~ wake the record at the default grain`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`instance` params=`pet/lares-alpha instance/s-01 ~ join the presence and take each slot's digest`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`resume` params=`pet/lares-alpha source/resume ~ a resume reads one line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face · pet · aperture · source · instance · held · title · mandate

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`pet` params=`takes/pet-name needs/required seat/1 as/<pet> ~ the spirit's pet name: lower-case letters, digits and hyphens`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`aperture` params=`takes/rank default/measure ~ the fold's grain: a rank, a level 0..20, or the pair 10/measure`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`source` params=`takes/word default/startup ~ the wake's turn: startup, resume, fork, compaction or precompact`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`instance` params=`takes/session-id ~ the waking instance; joins the presence`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`held` params=`kind/switch ~ the session's own counter holds this instance`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`title` params=`takes/title ~ wake onto another record the shrine names`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`mandate` params=`takes/ref ~ a summoned instance's mandate as <uri>@<hash>`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ocap/read-on-the-daemon-wiki ~ every read rides the tiddler door's own daemon verbs, whose gates stand over each act`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · spirit-pet-malformed · spirit-ambiguous · mandate-unknown · mandate-moved · mandate-names-another · mandate-face-turned

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.wakes pet/lares-alpha]] ~ a malformed aperture=, source=, instance=, mandate= or a missing pet`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-pet-malformed` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.wakes pet/lares-alpha]] ~ the word reads as no pet name`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-ambiguous` params=`~ both familiar/<pet> and spirit/<pet> stand; the door names both and guesses neither`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`mandate-unknown` params=`~ no mandate stands at the uri the line names`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`mandate-moved` params=`~ the mandate reads another hash than the line names; the wake stops`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`mandate-names-another` params=`~ the mandate names another pet or instance`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`mandate-face-turned` params=`~ the mandate echoes another face than the one answering; name it with face=`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ woke · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`woke` params=`exit/0 fields/[[pet uri kind source face text chars]] ~ the folded card, its testimony and the commands it hands back`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/2 ~ the door refused by name (exit 2, 4 or 5); the line carries the cure`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

